OL,3,GNEWSAHospice facing more demand than
OL,4,Aever
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospice has warned that demand for
OL,7,Fits services is set to increase by 30%
OL,8,Fover the next five years and that
OL,9,Ffunding is not growing to match.
OL,11,FSobell House says at any one time it is
OL,12,Fsupporting 1,439 patients, more than
OL,13,Fdouble the 680 people it was supporting
OL,14,Fjust a year ago.
OL,16,FCampaigners have been calling for
OL,17,Ffairer funding for hospices amid rising
OL,18,Fcosts, increasing demand and widening
OL,19,Ffunding gaps.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
